      "com.microsoft.edgemac"
    ],
    "window_title": []
  },
  "sources": [
    "https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/edge/keyboard-shortcuts-in-microsoft-edge"
  ],
  "note": "From Microsoft's \"Keyboard shortcuts in Microsoft Edge\" support page. Where the page lists more than one chord for an action, only the primary chord is recorded (a second, clearly distinct alternate is kept as its own action, e.g. F5 alongside Ctrl+R). \"Ctrl+1 through Ctrl+8\" is expanded into 8 explicit tab-switch actions. Skipped as not expressible: touchpad/mouse gestures and pen-only shortcuts documented elsewhere on Microsoft's Edge accessibility pages.",
